# Repository-wide ignore rules.
#
# This file deliberately stays at the repository root: it carries repository-wide
# meaning (in particular the environment-file guard below, which must apply to
# every directory including Vulnerabilities/). Project-local rules live in
# Visualizer/.gitignore and Vulnerabilities/.gitignore.

# Environment and credential files -- never commit these, anywhere in the tree.
.env
.env.*
*.env
!*.env.example
*.pem
*.key
!**/public/**/*.key

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
